# Parrotfish's AZERTY keys, by the same phone geometry as phone-qwerty.layout
# (not logged on a phone): units are key widths, rows 1.67 key widths
# tall; ' takes the place of fr.qml's ç after n.
pitch 1.67
0    1 azertyuiop
0    1 qsdfghjklm
1.5  1 wxcvbn'
